From 0f8e4c8d5643f93156c19c87b398d1d27b87fa6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 09:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: support openEuler 3.27

The openEuler 24.03 LTS SP3 buildroot provides CMake 3.27.  The 3.4.0
sources use no CMake command newer than that version, and upstream's own
comment states that older versions are expected to work.  Lower only the
declared policy floor so the otherwise unmodified project can configure.
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 3e759a2..a72db2b 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -4 +4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.29...4.0.1)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.27...4.0.1)
